[Orientation "white"]

1. d4 d5 2. Bf4
{ [%anno "FunnyAnimatorJimTV", funnyanimatorjimtv] Starting with d4 and Bf4 }
2... c5 3. e3 e6 4. c3
{ [%anno "FunnyAnimatorJimTV", funnyanimatorjimtv] I built my pyramid [%csl Rb2,Rc3,Rd4,Re3,Rf2][%cal Rf2d4,Rb2d4] }
4... Nc6
{ [%anno "FunnyAnimatorJimTV", funnyanimatorjimtv] Black developed the knight [%csl Gc6] }
5. Nd2
{ [%anno "FunnyAnimatorJimTV", funnyanimatorjimtv] I develop my queen knight [%csl Gd2][%cal Gb1d2] }
5... h6
{ [%anno "FunnyAnimatorJimTV", funnyanimatorjimtv] An utterly pointless bunny-ear move. I BEG YOU not to play moves like this in your games. [%csl Bh6][%cal Bh7h6] }
6. Ngf3 Nf6 7. Bd3
{ [%anno "FunnyAnimatorJimTV", funnyanimatorjimtv] Developed all my minor pieces [%csl Bd2,Bd3,Bf3] }
7... Bd6
{ [%anno "FunnyAnimatorJimTV", funnyanimatorjimtv] Standoff. Do we take? Of course not, because that releases tension, and releasing tension is bad. [%cal Rd6f4,Rf4d6] }
8. Bg3
{ [%anno "FunnyAnimatorJimTV", funnyanimatorjimtv] Instead we step back a bit and allow them to take us if they want. [%cal Bd6g3] }
8... O-O 9. Ne5
{ [%anno "FunnyAnimatorJimTV", funnyanimatorjimtv] Ne5, the key move. Occupying the center [%csl Ge5][%cal Gf3e5] }
9... Qc7
{ [%anno "FunnyAnimatorJimTV", funnyanimatorjimtv] The knight is attacked [%csl Re5][%cal Rc7e5] }
10. f4
{ [%anno "FunnyAnimatorJimTV", funnyanimatorjimtv] Which beautifully makes us go into a Stonewall. Because we prevented e5, black's light squared bishop stays blocked in and will most likely be a dead piece for black the whole game, while all of the white pieces are very happy. :) [%csl Gb2,Gc3,Gd4,Ge3,Gf4,Rc8][%cal Gf4e5,Gd4e5,Rc8e6] }
10... a6
{ [%anno "FunnyAnimatorJimTV", funnyanimatorjimtv] Maybe black is going to try and undermine this white queenside pawn chain [%csl Rc3,Rd4,Rb2][%cal Bb7b5,Bb5b4,Bb4c3] }
11. Bh4
{ [%anno "FunnyAnimatorJimTV", funnyanimatorjimtv] I reposition this bishop, getting ready to swap off that knight that protects the black king [%csl Gh4][%cal Rh4f6,Gg3h4] }
11... Be7 12. g4
{ [%anno "FunnyAnimatorJimTV", funnyanimatorjimtv] Here comes the attack!! [%csl Rg4,Rf4][%cal Rg2g4,Rg4g5] }
12... cxd4 *
